{"4753380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "My Toxic Darling", "steam_appid": 4753380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every darling has a story. Every story has a price.</h2><br>MY TOXIC DARLING is a first-person co-op psychological horror set in a sealed facility. Two of you drive one body through the dark. The strangers seated in these rooms all want to talk - and the things that stopped talking are already moving toward the noise you just made. <strong>You have until midnight.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4753380/extras/557481bf25fd21f9382bd81eebe42dd3.avif?t=1788161473\" width=616 height=156 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4753380/extras/8c4d99d1e597c789da149d70ab59c160.poster.avif?t=1788161473\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4753380/extras/8c4d99d1e597c789da149d70ab59c160.webm?t=1788161473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4753380/extras/8c4d99d1e597c789da149d70ab59c160.mp4?t=1788161473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Sit down, listen to what they did, and choose your words.</strong> Every answer is being marked, and what you become to them - an ally, a stranger, or an enemy - decides whether a door opens or something starts hunting you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4753380/extras/81a44bd2c68e8c402b472ac24b0284c9.avif?t=1788161473\" width=616 height=156 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4753380/extras/29c172ddf79440b8e42664b1f88c1b1f.poster.avif?t=1788161473\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4753380/extras/29c172ddf79440b8e42664b1f88c1b1f.webm?t=1788161473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4753380/extras/29c172ddf79440b8e42664b1f88c1b1f.mp4?t=1788161473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>One of you moves.</strong> One of you looks. You are the same person, so a mistake in one pair of hands is a mistake in both. Some answers you take in turns, and you will not always agree.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4753380/extras/9249773ea4e7ec83d4a8fe712bcff320.avif?t=1788161473\" width=616 height=156 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4753380/extras/bf4b87e8847639ec3df11794c77f8ce1.poster.avif?t=1788161473\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4753380/extras/bf4b87e8847639ec3df11794c77f8ce1.webm?t=1788161473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4753380/extras/bf4b87e8847639ec3df11794c77f8ce1.mp4?t=1788161473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>A bell marks every hour you waste.</strong> When the last one rings the fog comes up through the floor - and it never comes in alone.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4753380/extras/1b5c40076ef80cd3700fb11998b69b3f.avif?t=1788161473\" width=616 height=156 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4753380/extras/c260173df8e3a074453f446d9a823c5b.poster.avif?t=1788161473\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4753380/extras/c260173df8e3a074453f446d9a823c5b.webm?t=1788161473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4753380/extras/c260173df8e3a074453f446d9a823c5b.mp4?t=1788161473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Not everything down here wants to be asked a question.</strong> Some of it just walks toward the sound you made. Telling the difference is the whole job.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4753380/extras/fd42d23ca139a1402910e7ed6b05275f.avif?t=1788161473\" width=616 height=156 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4753380/extras/5b87be41adc9a2b62689774415665c01.poster.avif?t=1788161473\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4753380/extras/5b87be41adc9a2b62689774415665c01.webm?t=1788161473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4753380/extras/5b87be41adc9a2b62689774415665c01.mp4?t=1788161473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Three keys. One gate.</strong> Who you have to win over, and what you have to take them from, is different every single night.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ WHAT'S IN THE DARK</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Two-player online co-op</strong> - one shared body, split controls, in-game proximity voice chat<br></li><li><strong>Sit-down interrogations</strong> - every answer moves a hidden score<br></li><li><strong>A procedurally generated facility</strong> - no two nights are laid out the same<br></li><li><strong>A real clock</strong>, a rising fog, and a session that ends either way<br></li><li><strong>Things that talk</strong>, and things that only follow<br></li><li><strong>Forty minutes until midnight</strong> - solo, as a couple, or in teams<br></li><li><strong>New strangers every night</strong> - and the answers never sit in the same place twice<br></li><li><strong>Full interface and subtitles</strong> - English, Korean, Japanese, Simplified/Traditional Chinese, Russian, German, French, Spanish, Portuguese (Brazil/Portugal)</li></ul><br><strong>Get out before midnight. If you don't - they're still keeping score.</strong><br><br><i>Contains flashing lights, sudden loud noises and depictions of violence.</i><br>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every darling has a story. Every story has a price.</h2><br>MY TOXIC DARLING is a first-person co-op psychological horror set in a sealed facility. Two of you drive one body through the dark. The strangers seated in these rooms all want to talk - and the things that stopped talking are already moving toward the noise you just made. <strong>You have until midnight.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4753380/extras/557481bf25fd21f9382bd81eebe42dd3.avif?t=1788161473\" width=616 height=156 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4753380/extras/8c4d99d1e597c789da149d70ab59c160.poster.avif?t=1788161473\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4753380/extras/8c4d99d1e597c789da149d70ab59c160.webm?t=1788161473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4753380/extras/8c4d99d1e597c789da149d70ab59c160.mp4?t=1788161473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Sit down, listen to what they did, and choose your words.</strong> Every answer is being marked, and what you become to them - an ally, a stranger, or an enemy - decides whether a door opens or something starts hunting you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4753380/extras/81a44bd2c68e8c402b472ac24b0284c9.avif?t=1788161473\" width=616 height=156 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4753380/extras/29c172ddf79440b8e42664b1f88c1b1f.poster.avif?t=1788161473\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4753380/extras/29c172ddf79440b8e42664b1f88c1b1f.webm?t=1788161473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4753380/extras/29c172ddf79440b8e42664b1f88c1b1f.mp4?t=1788161473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>One of you moves.</strong> One of you looks. You are the same person, so a mistake in one pair of hands is a mistake in both. Some answers you take in turns, and you will not always agree.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4753380/extras/9249773ea4e7ec83d4a8fe712bcff320.avif?t=1788161473\" width=616 height=156 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4753380/extras/bf4b87e8847639ec3df11794c77f8ce1.poster.avif?t=1788161473\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4753380/ext