eam/apps/4753380/extras/5b87be41adc9a2b62689774415665c01.webm?t=1788161473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4753380/extras/5b87be41adc9a2b62689774415665c01.mp4?t=1788161473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Three keys. One gate.</strong> Who you have to win over, and what you have to take them from, is different every single night.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ WHAT'S IN THE DARK</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Two-player online co-op</strong> - one shared body, split controls, in-game proximity voice chat<br></li><li><strong>Sit-down interrogations</strong> - every answer moves a hidden score<br></li><li><strong>A procedurally generated facility</strong> - no two nights are laid out the same<br></li><li><strong>A real clock</strong>, a rising fog, and a session that ends either way<br></li><li><strong>Things that talk</strong>, and things that only follow<br></li><li><strong>Forty minutes until midnight</strong> - solo, as a couple, or in teams<br></li><li><strong>New strangers every night</strong> - and the answers never sit in the same place twice<br></li><li><strong>Full interface and subtitles</strong> - English, Korean, Japanese, Simplified/Traditional Chinese, Russian, German, French, Spanish, Portuguese (Brazil/Portugal)</li></ul><br><strong>Get out before midnight. If you don't - they're still keeping score.</strong><br><br><i>Contains flashing lights, sudden loud noises and depictions of violence.</i><br>", "short_description": "You wake in a dungeon where strangers sit in chairs, each with a story about their lover. Listen, judge, and answer. Empathize or turn hostile — every choice changes how they treat you. Find three keys and escape before time runs out. Play solo, or as a couple in two-player co-op.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, P